      "content": "That's a good start. I want to add a section on identifying early warning signs of escalation. Sometimes the aggression isn't immediate; it's a gradual shift in behavior. Could you list some specific non-verbal cues or behavioral changes that nurses should look out for that might indicate a patient is starting to lose control or become volatile?",
